[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0010","text":"Producer先生……\n说还要再一会儿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0020","text":"啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0030","text":"那就坐电车去不就好了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0040","text":"今天拍摄的地方\n没那么远吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0050","text":"从最近的车站过去\n好像要走不少路呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0060","text":"嘿～\n那等着就对了嘛～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0070","text":"那、那总之\n先跟他说我们在学校等着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0080","text":"我联系一下Producer先生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0090","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_01_0100","text":"跟他说快点来哦～？"}]
